// Smoke-test TB template — used by bench/cvdp/smoke.py to verify
// each extracted problem's harness layout works end-to-end. The TB
// instantiates the DUT, drives no inputs, and exits cleanly. Coverage
// will be near zero; the point is to confirm the build + run pipeline
// works for each problem before any real authoring happens.
//
// The harness substitutes `{TOP_MODULE}` with each problem's actual
// top module name at smoke time.

test SmokeTest
    let dut : {TOP_MODULE}
end test SmokeTest

impl sim for SmokeTest
    run
        wait 1 cycle
        log(info, "smoke: DUT alive")
    end run
end impl SmokeTest
